# Why you had to uninstall the original app

The original Galaxy Wearable installation came from Google Play:

```text
installerPackageName=com.android.vending
initiatingPackageName=com.android.vending
```

Your rebuilt APK was signed with a different signing key.

Android therefore would not allow the modified APK to replace the Play Store version as an update.

So you uninstalled the original Galaxy Wearable and then installed the modified one.

You installed it from Windows with:

